### ShopService - przykładowe żądania (Rider: HTTP Client)
@identityUrl = https://localhost:7001
@baseUrl = https://localhost:7002

### Logowanie administratora w IdentityService (konto z seeda)
POST {{identityUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@shop.local",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("accessToken", response.body.tokens.accessToken);
%}

### Kategorie
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/categories

### Produkty - wyszukiwanie w kategorii, od najtańszych
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?categoryId=019a5a10-0000-7000-8000-000000000004&search=mata&sort=PriceAsc&page=1&pageSize=20

### Szczegóły produktu
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/019a5a10-0000-7000-9000-000000000010

### Złożenie zamówienia (wyślij dwa razy – drugi raz 200 z tym samym zamówieniem dzięki Idempotency-Key)
# @name placeOrder
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Idempotency-Key: 6f1c2a90-0000-4000-8000-000000000001
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    { "productId": "019a5a10-0000-7000-9000-000000000010", "quantity": 1 },
    { "productId": "019a5a10-0000-7000-9000-000000000012", "quantity": 2 }
  ],
  "shippingAddress": {
    "recipient": "Jan Kowalski",
    "street": "Długa 1/2",
    "postalCode": "00-001",
    "city": "Warszawa",
    "phone": "+48 600 000 000"
  }
}

> {%
    client.global.set("orderId", response.body.id);
%}

### Moje zamówienia
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Admin - nowa kategoria (slug powstanie z nazwy)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Zabawki",
  "description": "Dla dzieci i dorosłych."
}

### Admin - nowy produkt
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/products
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryId": "019a5a10-0000-7000-8000-000000000001",
  "name": "Powerbank 20 000 mAh",
  "description": "Dwa porty USB-C.",
  "price": 149.99,
  "stock": 30,
  "isActive": true
}

### Admin - zamówienia ze statusem New
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/orders?status=New
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Admin - oznaczenie jako opłacone (dalej: /ship, /mark-delivered; /cancel zwraca towar do magazynu)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/orders/{{orderId}}/mark-paid
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
